Description:You control Expedition Envoy enchanted with Snake Umbra and three Mountains, and have Anger of the Gods and Lightning Bolt in hand. The opponent controls two Hill Giants. End the turn with both Hill Giants in exile and Expedition Envoy still on your battlefield.
